# Raw AR pipeline inputs and intermediates (~1.6 GB).
# Meshy exports ~90 MB per dish; scripts/one-off/optimize-ar-glbs.ps1 turns those
# into the ~1 MB models actually served from public/uploads. Only the outputs are
# worth versioning — see aiclone/docs/AR.md to regenerate.
ar-raw/

# Database dumps. These carry real visitor conversations, leads and user emails,
# and this repository is public — they must never be committed. Keep them here
# for local restore and copy them somewhere off this machine.
backups/
*.dump
*.sql.gz
